<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP SELLS PLN 198 MLN 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP SELLS PLN 198 MLN 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 198 million zlotys worth of 91-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 258 million zlotys worth of the bills, the bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield inched up 0.04 point to 19.51 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
